      ":question/problem": "Calculate $\\int \\frac{2x}{(x^{2}+5)^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x$, using $u=x^{2}+5$ and $\\text{d}u=2x\\,\\text{d}x$.",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Let $u=x^{2}+5.$ Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=2x\\,\u27f9\\,\\text{d}u=2x\\,\\text{d}x,\n$$\n\nand we can solve the resulting integral as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{2x}{(x^{2}+5)^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int \\frac{1}{(x^{2}+5)^{2}}\\cdot 2x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ & =\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2}}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\ & =-\\frac{1}{u}+C \\\\ & =-\\frac{1}{x^{2}+5}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$",
